<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of March 15, 1999 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a first tranche of 18-month October 15, 1998 CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Oct 15, 98  Pvs    Mar 15, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.92 pct    6.57   6.01 pct    6.51</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.76	  7.31   6.84	  7.35</p>
<p>Assigned price 90.65	 91.25  88.10	 87.00</p>
<p>Bids	     5.770 trillion lire   5.376 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.000 trillion lire   2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with previous auctions of CTZs on March 25.</p>
</text>
